[{"id":3206866811,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6_JOd7","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Tested locally, it works as expected. Code looks good to me.\r\n\r\nIn terms of usability, I think this is a pretty nice improvement already. I prefer the new location of the intensity slider too, it's easier on muscle memory when switching between no-alpha and with-alpha color pickers.\r\n\r\nSome feedback:\r\n\r\n- When switching the editor to a light theme, the \"color picker type\" icon in the right isn't updated:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"536\" height=\"135\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7ab433b4-3dcc-43be-8dd0-047351014839\" />\r\n\r\nAll color picker icon types in the dropdown are also affected:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"302\" height=\"317\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b317b330-6ed1-4abc-aa32-dd0bc3191f30\" />\r\n\r\nIn both cases, this happens even after restarting the editor, so the issue isn't in a lack of `NOTIFICATION_THEME_CHANGED` usage. It's either the icon file having an incorrect color, or the icon being incorrectly listed in the icon conversion exclusions.\r\n\r\n- Pressing <kbd>Ctrl + Enter</kbd> on the color text field should focus it and select all its text, so you can enter another color code or name afterwards without needing to click with the mouse.\r\n\r\n- Some icons don't scale up for hiDPI displays in the editor, like the context menu icons next to the Swatches section:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"196\" height=\"263\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/562f2a85-c095-4459-baa4-c2b2428f0f8b\" />\r\n\r\nAs well as the \"Swatches\" and \"Recent colors\" chevrons:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"85\" height=\"117\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/30c75a99-b93e-4fff-93f4-5bf8fe093c88\" />\r\n\r\n- The Swatches context menu icon should also have a square minimum size, so that its clickable area is always square:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"63\" height=\"66\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f1688111-b89b-42f7-875b-920f8379bbd9\" />\r\n\r\n___\r\n\r\nFor future PRs:\r\n\r\n- We could make the value slider slightly rounded to match the focus StyleBox, so that it doesn't poke out of the focus StyleBox like it does currently:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"52\" height=\"28\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3b21bad5-4fb8-485a-9d77-e110d9bac8bb\" />\r\n\r\nThis also applies to the corners of rectangle color pickers:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"39\" height=\"15\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b2e46f6d-61cf-4f9f-8372-6852a011593c\" />\r\n\r\nAlternatively, we can use special focus StyleBoxes that don't have rounded corners for those (it should be easier to implement).\r\n\r\n- The focus outline for the color picker circle could be antialiased:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"96\" height=\"56\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/68e44464-19eb-491c-9bd6-92378aa6a213\" />\r\n\r\nThe main circle is already antialiased, although it should perhaps use a slightly wider feather to improve quality.\r\n","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110157#pullrequestreview-3206866811","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110157","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110157#pullrequestreview-3206866811"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110157"}},"submitted_at":"2025-09-10T16:10:55Z","commit_id":null},{"id":3211412154,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6_akK6","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Works great now 🙂 \r\n\r\nI noticed the \"revert to old color\" icon gets converted when using a light theme in the editor, but it shouldn't, as it's always drawn over a background that does not depend on the theme color:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"35\" height=\"28\" alt=\"Screenshot 2025-09-11 at 14 55 59\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b533e4c8-75ce-4c97-8622-3ad3efa779b7\" />\r\n\r\nIts modulation is set according to the background color - if it's light enough, the icon gets darkened, otherwise it's drawn with the standard color (which is a light icon for dark theme).\r\n\r\nThis issue is also present in `master` so it's not critical to fix here, but it may be worth a look at nonetheless.","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110157#pullrequestreview-3211412154","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110157","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110157#pullrequestreview-3211412154"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110157"}},"submitted_at":"2025-09-11T12:57:26Z","commit_id":null},{"id":3212104320,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6_dNKA","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"","state":"DISMISSED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110157#pullrequestreview-3212104320","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110157","author_association":"MEMBER","_l